<p>These standard terms may be used as default customer-facing terms for loyalty programs powered by Reviko. A Merchant may publish additional or different program-specific terms.</p>

  <h2>1. Age Requirement</h2>
  <p>Participation through Reviko is intended only for individuals <strong>18 years of age or older</strong>.</p>

  <h2>2. Voluntary Participation</h2>
  <p>Participation in a loyalty program is voluntary. By enrolling, the Customer agrees to these terms and any additional rules published by the participating Merchant.</p>

  <h2>3. Earning</h2>
  <p>Points, visits, stamps, or other loyalty credit are earned only through qualifying activity recognized as valid by the Merchant.</p>

  <h2>4. No Cash Value</h2>
  <p>Unless the Merchant expressly states otherwise, loyalty points, visits, stamps, and rewards:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>do not constitute money or stored value;</li>
    <li>may not be exchanged for cash;</li>
    <li>do not accrue interest; and</li>
    <li>are not transferable.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Rewards</h2>
  <p>Rewards are offered and provided directly by the participating Merchant. Rewards may be subject to product, location, timing, availability, expiration, or other restrictions disclosed by the Merchant.</p>

  <h2>6. Fraud and Abuse</h2>
  <p>The Merchant may cancel or reverse loyalty activity reasonably determined to result from fraud, duplication, manipulation, misuse, or abuse.</p>

  <h2>7. Program Changes</h2>
  <p>The Merchant may reasonably modify its loyalty program prospectively, subject to applicable law and any customer rights that cannot lawfully be waived.</p>

  <h2>8. Program Termination</h2>
  <p>A Merchant may terminate a loyalty program subject to applicable law and the Merchant’s customer-facing commitments. Previously earned rights or rewards may remain enforceable where required by law or the Merchant’s published terms.</p>

  <h2>9. Reviko's Role</h2>
  <p>Reviko is a technology platform operated by 77 Studio LLC. Reviko provides infrastructure used to administer the program.</p>
  <p>The participating Merchant—not Reviko—is the provider responsible for the products, services, discounts, and rewards offered through the program.</p>

  <h2>10. Apple Wallet and Google Wallet</h2>
  <p>A loyalty pass may be available through Apple Wallet or Google Wallet. Those services are operated by third parties and are subject to their own terms and availability.</p>

  <h2>11. Privacy</h2>
  <p>Information related to participation in a loyalty program is handled in accordance with the <a href="/en/privacy">Reviko Privacy Policy</a> and, where applicable, the participating Merchant’s privacy notice.</p>

  <h2>12. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about a specific reward or program rule should first be directed to the participating Merchant.</p>
  <p>Questions about Reviko technology may be directed to <a href="mailto:support@reviko.io">support@reviko.io</a>.</p>
